{
    "version": "nightly",
    "description": "Steam（Scoop 便携；库与用户数据 persist，C 盘 LocalAppData 联接）",
    "homepage": "https://store.steampowered.com/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Freeware",
        "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/legal/"
    },
    "url": "https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/client/installer/SteamSetup.exe#/dl.7z",
    "pre_install": "Remove-Item \"$dir\\`$PLUGINSDIR\" -Force -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
    "post_install": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/steam/post_install.ps1'",
    "pre_uninstall": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/steam/pre_uninstall.ps1'",
    "uninstaller": {
        "file": "uninstall.exe",
        "args": "/S"
    },
    "bin": "Steam.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "Steam.exe",
            "Steam"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": [
        "config",
        "skins",
        "steamapps",
        "userdata"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "安装需管理员：写入 HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\WOW6432Node\\Valve\\Steam（InstallPath + Users 可写），并注册 SteamService；否则会报 registry path not writable。",
        "开始菜单 Steam.lnk 会写入 AUMID Valve.Steam.Client，避免任务栏显示空白占位图标。",
        "Scoop persist：config / skins / steamapps / userdata（游戏库在 steamapps；登录与库路径在 config）。",
        "%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Steam → persist/LocalAppData（htmlcache 等）。",
        "客户端自身会热更新；manifest 为 nightly，一般不必靠 scoop update 升 Steam。",
        "若已有 D:\\Program\\Steam：先退出，把 steamapps/userdata/config 迁到 persist\\steam 对应目录后再装，避免重复下载。"
    ]
}
